{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"高空坠物","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"624f4755d63d159c0df79ea1b37f42b5d7460f655f63885f64d2cfeea9b018c2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"企鹅物流的另一名员工——德克萨斯带来了撤退路线的信息。\n然而，这股整合运动的表现让众人感到不安——他们的首领似乎认识米莎。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛，好慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——哦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快到截击地点了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，终于......明明刚打开包装。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"浪费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快点！后面的，跟紧了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的面具人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"一起上吧，我赶时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，企鹅物流的德克萨斯已归队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"有些新情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我干掉了不少，那些叫整合运动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——但他们后面，跟着的更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动已经放弃了最开始的伪装，开始集体行动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然是这样吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动已经通过贫民区混进龙门......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......目标和我们相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，他们没理由追击我们罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎小姐身上，有龙门和整合运动才知道的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这对罗德岛很不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"形势有点不容乐观啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿得去戳戳那个督察的漂亮脸蛋问个明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的话，我来带路。我很清楚该怎么走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使已经确定了撤退路线，我带你们过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，集合各个小队，我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我们？我们得先找个掩体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动已经到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在这边！别让他们跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"追在尾巴后面的麻烦是最讨厌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——不对——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......有首领！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"当心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨，他们就在这儿——是她没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"术师们，去吧，去把这些人撕得稀碎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"口出狂言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！敌人派出了多个术师，注意对策！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对方的目标是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——米莎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_firstcontact"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我终于......找到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
